// @id 01M61KJ9DSXD521YHQP0J6MCQQ model=basic-example
q: Newton's first law states that..
a: $$\sum \boldsymbol{F}_{\mathrm{ext}} = \boldsymbol{0} \quad \Longrightarrow \quad \boldsymbol{a} = \boldsymbol{0} \quad \Longrightarrow \quad \boldsymbol{v} = \mathrm{constant}$$

// @id 01M61KJ9DS06RBPJY38D371VXC model=basic-example
q: Newton's second law states that..
a: $$\sum \boldsymbol{F}_{\mathrm{ext}} = m\boldsymbol{a}$$
$$\sum F_x = ma_x, \quad \sum F_y = ma_y, \quad \sum F_z = ma_z$$

// @id 01M61KJ9DSFY8PD7W0RJWY7K5G model=basic-example
q: Newton's third law states that..
a: $$\boldsymbol{F}_{A \leftarrow B} = -\boldsymbol{F}_{B \leftarrow A}$$
